      "raw": "<p>Thanks, everyone. It is a little OP, admittedly, but we promise to use it only in the direst of circumstances. We set up an entire game, had the counters out and everything- Akash-bhuta in Silver Gulch. I was playing Grandpa Legacy and Expat, and he had AA and Unity. Villian round had AA in ensnaring brambles and a carapace out. Luckily, the card is also irreducible.</p><p>I actually drew a hand and laid out my strategy. then he had my two best friends call and show up at my place, acting like they&#39;d lost their minds (fake tattoos and mint juleps were involved) to distract me. When I came back up, he&#39;d tucked another card into Legacy&#39;s hand.</p>",
